        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Fred, Neymar\n- Organizations: Atlético Mineiro, Brazil national football team, Spain national football team\n- Places: Belo Horizonte, Minas Gerais, Brazil\n- Roles: striker\n- Events: 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final\n- Topics: Brazilian professional football\n\nFacts:\n- Fred, whose full name is Frederico Chaves Guedes, was born on 3 October 1983.\n- Fred is a Brazilian professional footballer who plays as a striker for Atlético Mineiro.\n- Atlético Mineiro is a professional football club based in Belo Horizonte, Minas Gerais, Brazil.\n- Atlético Mineiro is commonly known as Atlético Mineiro or Atlético and is colloquially called Galo.\n- In the 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final, Brazil defeated Spain 3–0.\n- In the 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final, Fred and Neymar scored the goals in Brazil's 3–0 win over Spain.\n- Brazil's 3–0 victory over Spain in the 2013 FIFA Confederations Cup Final ended Spain's record of 29 games without defeat.",
